## Sarcophagus OS hardened Tor Configuration

User debian-Tor
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor

# Transparent Proxying for system-wide TCP intercept
TransPort 127.0.0.1:9040

# Local Tor DNS Resolver (Eidolon hooks into this port 5353)
DNSPort 127.0.0.1:5353

# Prevent IP leaks via failed DNS lookups
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
AutomapHostsSuffixes .exit,.onion

@ Security & Anonymity Hardening
DisableDebuggerAttachment 1
SafeLogging 1
AviodDisjointRouting 1
KeepalivePeriod 60

# Disable socks port external listeners
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050
